{title: I Am The Highway (Versión Simplificada)}
{subtitle: Audioslave}
{time: 6/8}

{c: RASGUEO: ↓ ↓ ↑ ↑ ↑ ↓ (2 abajo, 3 arriba, 1 abajo)}
{c: Mano suave, marcando el bajo con el pulgar}

{comment: ACORDES BÁSICOS EN NOTACIÓN LATINA}
{define Sol base-fret 1 frets 3 2 0 0 0 3}
{define Lam base-fret 1 frets x 0 2 2 1 0}
{define Do base-fret 1 frets x 3 2 0 1 0}
{define Fa base-fret 1 frets 1 3 3 2 1 1}
{define Rem base-fret 1 frets x x 0 2 3 1}
{define Mi base-fret 1 frets 0 2 2 1 0 0}
{define Do/Si base-fret 1 frets x 2 0 0 1 0}

{c: INTRO (x2)}
[Do] [Sol] [Rem] [Lam] 
[Do] [Sol] [Rem] [Lam] 

{c: VERSO 1}
[Fa]Pearls and [Do]swine be[Sol]reft of [Lam]me
