[Sol]Alone in the [Do]hills [Lam]
[Fa]No sorrow [Do]or pity [Lam]
[Sol]For leav[Do]ing, I [Lam]feel

{c: CORO}
[Do]I am not your [Sol]rolling [Rem]wheels
